OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's nursery farm
OL,4,Ashortlisted for award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursery which took on a working farm
OL,7,Fto help small children develop skills
OL,8,Fand confidence has been nominated for a
OL,9,Fnational award.
OL,11,FAlderney Children's Centre took over
OL,12,Fthe two-acre (1-hectare) farm in
OL,13,FJanuary, enabling youngsters aged six
OL,14,Fmonths to five years to care for
OL,15,Fanimals, tend to crops and enjoy life
OL,16,Foutdoors.
OL,18,FIts team, which provides a nursery,
OL,19,Fforest school and farm, is now the only
OL,20,Fnominee from the bailiwick shortlisted
OL,21,Ffor the Business Development Award at
OL,22,Fthis year's Nursery World Awards.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
